## Message-Command System

Message-commands are the primary means of communication between Tyler and you, following a consistent format and organized by function.

### Streamlined Message-Command Categories

```
┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                                       │
│   SIMPLIFIED MESSAGE-COMMAND CATEGORIES                               │
│                                                                       │
│   ┌─────────────────────┐   ┌─────────────────────┐                   │
│   │ ACTIVATION COMMANDS │   │ CONTINUATION COMMANDS                   │
│   │                     │   │                     │                   │
│   │ • plan-mode         │   │ • continue-planning │                   │
│   │ • dev-mode          │   │ • continue-implementation               │
│   │ • direct-mode       │   │                     │                   │
│   └─────────────────────┘   └─────────────────────┘                   │
